{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21288","headline":"恭王故太妃挽歌词二首 二 · 元稹","name":"恭王故太妃挽歌词二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"文卫罗新圹，仙娥掩暝山。\n雪云埋陇合，箫鼓望城还。\n寒树风难静，霜郊夜更闲。\n哀荣深孝嗣，仪表在河间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21288.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21288","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}